<main>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-50">
    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-0 h-[600px] bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-50 via-slate-50 to-transparent"
    ></div>

    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-40 top-28 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-indigo-200/40 blur-3xl"
    ></div>

    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-40 top-10 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-violet-200/40 blur-3xl"
    ></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-24 lg:px-8 lg:py-28">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
        <span
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700 shadow-sm"
        >
          <i data-lucide="calendar-check-2" class="h-4 w-4"></i>
          About SecureMySlot
        </span>

        <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl lg:leading-[1.08]">
          Making appointment booking
          <span class="text-indigo-600">simpler for everyone.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
          SecureMySlot was created to give service-based businesses a simpler
          way to manage appointments while giving customers a quick and
          convenient way to book online.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <%= link_to business_sign_up_path,
                      class: "inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-indigo-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:ring-offset-2" do %>
            Create your business account
            <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="h-4 w-4"></i>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-14 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-8">
      <div>
        <span
          class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700"
        >
          Why we exist
        </span>

        <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
          Booking appointments should not be complicated
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 leading-8 text-slate-600">
          <p>
            Running an appointment-based business already involves enough work.
            Managing availability, replying to booking enquiries, keeping track
            of customers and updating appointments should not take up more of
            your day than necessary.
          </p>

          <p>
            SecureMySlot brings those everyday booking tasks together in one
            straightforward platform.
          </p>

          <p>
            Businesses can manage their services, working hours, customers and
            appointments, while customers can choose an available time and book
            online without the usual back-and-forth.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div
          class="absolute -inset-6 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-200/60 to-violet-200/40 blur-2xl"
        ></div>

        <div class="relative rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-xl sm:p-10">
          <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-indigo-50 p-6">
              <span
                class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-indigo-600 text-white"
              >
                <i data-lucide="calendar-days" class="h-6 w-6"></i>
              </span>

              <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-950">
                Manage bookings
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
                Keep upcoming appointments and your daily schedule organised.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-violet-50 p-6">
              <span
                class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-violet-600 text-white"
              >
                <i data-lucide="clock-3" class="h-6 w-6"></i>
              </span>

              <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-950">
                Control availability
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
                Set working hours and breaks around the way your business works.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 p-6">
              <span
                class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-emerald-600 text-white"
              >
                <i data-lucide="users-round" class="h-6 w-6"></i>
              </span>

              <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-950">
                Organise customers
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
                Keep customer information and appointment history in one place.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 p-6">
              <span
                class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 text-white"
              >
                <i data-lucide="mouse-pointer-click" class="h-6 w-6"></i>
              </span>

              <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-950">
                Accept online bookings
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
                Give customers an easy way to book from their phone or computer.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why we built it -->
  <section class="bg-slate-950 py-20 text-white sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <span
          class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-indigo-500/15 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-300"
        >
          Our purpose
        </span>

        <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
          Why we built SecureMySlot
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
          We wanted to make the booking journey easier for the businesses
          managing appointments and the customers making them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
          <span
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-indigo-500/15 text-indigo-300"
          >
            <i data-lucide="message-square-off" class="h-6 w-6"></i>
          </span>

          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">
            Less back-and-forth
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">
            Customers should not need to send several messages or make multiple
            calls just to find an available appointment.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
          <span
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-violet-500/15 text-violet-300"
          >
            <i data-lucide="clipboard-check" class="h-6 w-6"></i>
          </span>

          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">
            Less administration
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">
            Businesses should not have to spend valuable working hours manually
            checking diaries, confirming availability and organising bookings.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
          <span
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-300"
          >
            <i data-lucide="calendar-check" class="h-6 w-6"></i>
          </span>

          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">
            A clearer booking process
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">
            SecureMySlot brings availability, services, customers and
            appointments into one system that is easy to manage.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Simplicity -->
  <section class="py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-14 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-8">
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span
                class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600"
              >
                <i data-lucide="briefcase-business" class="h-5 w-5"></i>
              </span>

              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-950">
                  Add your services
                </h3>

                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
                  Create services with individual prices, descriptions and
                  appointment durations.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span
                class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-violet-50 text-violet-600"
              >
                <i data-lucide="clock-arrow-up" class="h-5 w-5"></i>
              </span>

              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-950">
                  Set your working hours
                </h3>

                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
                  Configure opening times, breaks and availability around your
                  actual working day.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span
                class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600"
              >
                <i data-lucide="link" class="h-5 w-5"></i>
              </span>

              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-950">
                  Share your booking page
                </h3>

                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
                  Give customers a dedicated link where they can view your
                  services and choose an available appointment.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
        <span
          class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700"
        >
          Designed to stay simple
        </span>

        <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
          Software should make running your business easier
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 leading-8 text-slate-600">
          <p>
            We believe useful booking software should solve problems without
            introducing unnecessary complexity.
          </p>

          <p>
            SecureMySlot can be configured around your own services,
            appointment lengths, opening hours, breaks and availability instead
            of forcing your business into a rigid schedule.
          </p>

          <p>
            Your bookings, customer information and appointment history are
            kept organised in one place, giving you a clearer view of what is
            happening across your business.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who it is for -->
  <section class="bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <span
          class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-indigo-100 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700"
        >
          Built for service businesses
        </span>

        <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
          Made for businesses where appointments matter
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
          SecureMySlot can support independent professionals and growing
          service businesses across a wide range of industries.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5">
        <% industries = [
          ["scissors", "Barbers", "indigo"],
          ["sparkles", "Beauty", "rose"],
          ["dumbbell", "Personal Trainers", "emerald"],
          ["graduation-cap", "Tutors", "violet"],
          ["heart-pulse", "Therapists", "blue"],
          ["camera", "Photographers", "cyan"],
          ["briefcase-business", "Consultants", "amber"],
          ["spray-can", "Cleaners", "teal"],
          ["wrench", "Tradespeople", "orange"],
          ["shapes", "Other Services", "slate"]
        ] %>

        <% industries.each do |icon, name, colour| %>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 text-center shadow-sm">
            <span
              class="mx-auto flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-<%= colour %>-50 text-<%= colour %>-600"
            >
              <i data-lucide="<%= icon %>" class="h-5 w-5"></i>
            </span>

            <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">
              <%= name %>
            </p>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Customer experience -->
  <section class="py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-14 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-8">
      <div>
        <span
          class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700"
        >
          Built for both sides of the booking
        </span>

        <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
          A better experience for your customers too
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 leading-8 text-slate-600">
          <p>
            A booking system should not only work well for the business. The
            customer experience matters just as much.
          </p>

          <p>
            SecureMySlot gives customers a simple online booking process they
            can use from their phone, tablet or computer.
          </p>

          <p>
            They can choose the service they need, find an available
            appointment and manage eligible bookings through their customer
            account.
          </p>

          <p>
            This means businesses can continue accepting bookings even when
            they are busy, closed or unable to answer the phone.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
          <span
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600"
          >
            <i data-lucide="smartphone" class="h-6 w-6"></i>
          </span>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-950">
            Book from any device
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
            Customers can access your booking page from their phone, tablet or
            computer.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
          <span
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-violet-50 text-violet-600"
          >
            <i data-lucide="calendar-range" class="h-6 w-6"></i>
          </span>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-950">
            See real availability
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
            Customers are shown appointment times based on your configured
            working hours and existing bookings.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
          <span
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600"
          >
            <i data-lucide="bell-ring" class="h-6 w-6"></i>
          </span>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-950">
            Stay informed
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
            Booking confirmations and appointment updates help keep customers
            informed.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
          <span
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600"
          >
            <i data-lucide="history" class="h-6 w-6"></i>
          </span>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-950">
            Manage appointments
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
            Customers can view upcoming bookings and keep track of their
            appointment history.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="bg-slate-950 py-20 text-white sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <span
          class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-indigo-500/15 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-300"
        >
          Our approach
        </span>

        <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
          What matters to us
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
          <i data-lucide="circle-check-big" class="h-7 w-7 text-indigo-300"></i>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold">
            Keep it straightforward
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
            Booking software should be easy to understand and practical to use
            without unnecessary complexity.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
          <i data-lucide="settings-2" class="h-7 w-7 text-violet-300"></i>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold">
            Put businesses in control
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
            Configure your services, appointment durations, hours and
            availability around the way you operate.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
          <i data-lucide="mouse-pointer-click" class="h-7 w-7 text-emerald-300"></i>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold">
            Make booking convenient
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
            Give customers an easier way to find suitable appointments and book
            online.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
          <i data-lucide="refresh-cw" class="h-7 w-7 text-blue-300"></i>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold">
            Keep improving
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
            Continue developing useful tools around the changing needs of
            appointment-based businesses.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final text section -->
  <section class="py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span
        class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700"
      >
        Less admin, more time for your business
      </span>

      <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
        Helping businesses spend less time organising appointments
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
        Every minute spent manually arranging an appointment is time that could
        be spent serving customers, developing your business or getting through
        the rest of your working day.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
        From the first booking through to appointment management and customer
        records, SecureMySlot is focused on making the process clearer, quicker
        and easier to manage.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="px-4 pb-20 sm:px-6 sm:pb-24 lg:px-8">
    <div
      class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-14 text-center text-white shadow-xl sm:px-12 sm:py-16"
    >
      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-20 -top-20 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-3xl"
      ></div>

      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 -right-16 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-violet-400/30 blur-3xl"
      ></div>

      <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl">
        <span
          class="inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white/15"
        >
          <i data-lucide="calendar-check-2" class="h-7 w-7"></i>
        </span>

        <h2 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
          Ready to simplify your bookings?
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-indigo-100">
          Create your SecureMySlot business account, add your services, set
          your availability and start accepting appointments online.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <%= link_to business_sign_up_path,
                      class: "inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700 transition hover:bg-indigo-50" do %>
            Create your business account
            <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="h-4 w-4"></i>
          <% end %>

          <a
            href="/login"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/30 bg-white/10 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-white/20"
          >
            Sign in to your account
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>